Short:    Unrar 2.01, small bugfix for dir. problem.
Author:   a.vallinotto@agora.stm.it
Uploader: a.vallinotto@agora.stm.it
Version:  2.01
Type:     util/arc
Requires: OS2.0 (untested under 1.2-1.3)
Replaces: Unrar2.lha

This is a quick bugfix for UnRar 2.0. 
Unrar 2.0 had problems when operating on archives in the current directory...
SORRY GUYS! This problem was caused by the fact that both MS-DOS and Un*x use
'.' to indicate the current directory.

Zillions of thanks to Juergen Zeschky for the bugreport.

This version extracts correctly every RAR format known so far, including all
new formats introduced with RAR 2.00 .
This software is Freeware, but copyrighted by Eugeny Roshal for the original
code, and by me (Andrea Vallinotto) for the Amiga port.


